  "title": "Herc Rentals Earns Great Place to Work® Certification™ for 3rd Consecutive Year",
  "summary": "Herc Holdings Inc. (NYSE: HRI), one of North America’s leading equipment rental suppliers operating through Herc Rentals Inc. (“Herc Holdings,” “Herc Rentals” or the “Company”), today announced that it has earned 2026 Great Place To Work® Certification™ in the U.S. and Canada. This is the third consecutive year the Company has earned this distinction, demonstrating its ongoing commitment to fostering a positive workplace culture and employee experience. Receiving this distinguished certification",
